<!--
     BestROM brand mark: the dot-matrix lowercase "b" - a four-dot stem with a
     two-by-two bowl, matching the dotted lettering of the boot animation
     (vendor/bestrom/bootanimation). Kept at the same name, intrinsic size and
     viewport as the logo it replaces so every layout referencing @drawable/logo
     is unaffected.

     Dots are r=24 on a 62 pitch, centred in the viewport (x 114..286,
     y 83..317). Grey #8C919B on transparent, so the mark reads correctly on the
     black setup background and is not tinted by the theme accent.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="400dp"
    android:height="400dp"
    android:viewportWidth="400"
    android:viewportHeight="400">

